{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a fighter of modern warfare in Bayraktar and Stugna, a military simulator with an emphasis on gameplay diversity, where each mode is a separate combat mission with its own atmosphere and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Enter the battle on the legendary Bayraktar, using missiles and time dilation to destroy waves of enemy equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take the position of the Stugna-P operator and accurately strike enemy columns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Switch to FPV drones - control strike, loitering or kamikaze drones to accurately hit targets on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Act as an artillery commander - choose firing points, buy new self-propelled guns and watch the spectacular implementation of fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In MLRS mode, you control a multiple launch rocket system - cover enemy concentration areas with a barrage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take control of the air defense system, destroy drones, missiles, helicopters and aircraft, and discover new types of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take the helm in Aviation mode and clear the map of enemy air and ground forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Conduct a counterattack - launch tanks, infantry, drones, aircraft, special equipment into battle, use missile strikes and electronic warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Feel like an infantryman - choose one of several classes (SSO, sniper, engineer, medic, etc.), capture points, use equipment and drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf All your results are saved - track the destroyed equipment and enemies in the general statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 completely different game modes - bayraktars, stugns, fpv-drones, artillery, MLRS, air defense, aviation, counterattack, infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress and improvement system: unlock new equipment, weapons, abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical capabilities: time slowing, air strikes, electronic warfare, equipment repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of types of equipment: Bayraktar, Stugna, self-propelled guns, MLRS, FPV drones, aircraft, anti-aircraft guns, tanks, armored personnel carriers, infantry fighting vehicles, infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed statistics of all destroyed enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real events - a dedication to modern Ukrainian defenders.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Personnel destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757410/952872e41b796f509b06bc9a5db9847c0d132941.jpg"},{"name":"Tanks Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757410/2d9f184931828364224e9426110777e9624e4396.jpg"},{"name":"Armored vehicles destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757410/59be1854221126649d574b1e63c88350338951c7.jpg"},{"name":"Artillery Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757410/139fd614d9fbd849573881581337168ad9cc012d.jpg"},{"name":"MLRS Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757410/94ccaf6ab060db99bc1e9ffc2c10a01ca40c4909.jpg"},{"name":"Anti-Aircraft Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757410/9f3c74bf462cee20ef722039aa67eb5f60355c09.jpg"},{"name":"Aircraft Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757410/34a16a6da17e633a64e10ab000c0d7f48e96a994.jpg"},{"name":"Vehicles Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3757410/34628f5d490c22d5ed6069c9b2d7e585df9e0b0e.jpg"},{"name":"Ships Destroyed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamco