e spectacular implementation of fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 In MLRS mode, you control a multiple launch rocket system - cover enemy concentration areas with a barrage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take control of the air defense system, destroy drones, missiles, helicopters and aircraft, and discover new types of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Take the helm in Aviation mode and clear the map of enemy air and ground forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Conduct a counterattack - launch tanks, infantry, drones, aircraft, special equipment into battle, use missile strikes and electronic warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Feel like an infantryman - choose one of several classes (SSO, sniper, engineer, medic, etc.), capture points, use equipment and drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf All your results are saved - track the destroyed equipment and enemies in the general statistics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 completely different game modes - bayraktars, stugns, fpv-drones, artillery, MLRS, air defense, aviation, counterattack, infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress and improvement system: unlock new equipment, weapons, abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical capabilities: time slowing, air strikes, electronic warfare, equipment repair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of types of equipment: Bayraktar, Stugna, self-propelled guns, MLRS, FPV drones, aircraft, anti-aircraft guns, tanks, armored personnel carriers, infantry fighting vehicles, infantry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed statistics of all destroyed enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by real events - a dedication to modern Ukrainian defenders.</p>","developers":["Nebocry Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati